# This is a static site: it has no server of its own. A `server/` directory
# here is always a stray — it appeared once as a Chroma vector store written by
# Project 1's ingest script run from the wrong working directory. That store
# belongs at sales-recovery-agent/server/data/chroma/, and it was only kept out
# of the repository by the root .gitignore's `*.sqlite3` rule, which would not
# have caught the other files a Chroma run leaves behind.
server/

